      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Dead ends are fine if made deliberately. What the docs mean is that you shouldn't dead end if you intend to continue using your logic, the package does not. If anything, a dead end is more performant.\n\nThere is also no performance difference between a bool, int and float.\n\nI would still like to see this as an official parameter however, would at least save one animator layer.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
